@@ -0,0 +1,194 @@
+Feature: TodoMVC core
+  As a user
+  I want to manage my todos
+  So that I can track tasks
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  # ── Empty state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: No todos hides main and footer
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer is hidden
+
+  # ── New todo ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: Adding a todo via Enter key
+    When I enter a new todo "Buy milk" and press Enter
+    Then there is 1 todo
+    And the first todo has title "Buy milk"
+    And the input is empty
+    And the main section is visible
+    And the footer is visible
+
+  Scenario: Empty input is ignored
+    When I enter a new todo "" and press Enter
+    Then there are 0 todos
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only input is ignored
+    When I enter a new todo "   " and press Enter
+    Then there are 0 todos
+
+  Scenario: Todo title is trimmed
+    When I enter a new todo "  Buy milk  " and press Enter
+    Then the first todo has title "Buy milk"
+
+  # ── Mark complete ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: Clicking checkbox marks todo as completed
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle for todo 1
+    Then todo 1 is completed
+    And the active count is 0
+
+  Scenario: Unchecking restores active state
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have completed todo 1
+    When I click the toggle for todo 1
+    Then todo 1 is not completed
+    And the active count is 1
+
+  # ── Toggle all ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all checks every todo
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    When I click toggle-all
+    Then all todos are completed
+    And the active count is 0
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all unchecks when all are completed
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    And all todos are checked
+    When I click toggle-all
+    Then all todos are active
+    And the active count is 2
+
+  # ── Destroy ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: Destroying a todo removes it
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    When I destroy todo 1
+    Then there is 1 todo
+    And the first todo has title "Walk dog"
+
+  # ── Clear completed ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes finished todos
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    And I have completed todo 1
+    When I click clear-completed
+    Then there is 1 todo
+    And the first todo has title "Walk dog"
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed is hidden when none completed
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed is visible when some completed
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have completed todo 1
+    Then the clear-completed button is visible
+
+  # ── Editing ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: Double-click activates editing mode
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click todo 1
+    Then todo 1 is in editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Editing on Enter saves the new title
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click todo 1
+    And I type "Buy oat milk" in the edit field and press Enter
+    Then the first todo has title "Buy oat milk"
+    And todo 1 is not in editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Editing on blur saves the new title
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click todo 1
+    And I type "Buy oat milk" in the edit field and blur
+    Then the first todo has title "Buy oat milk"
+
+  Scenario: Empty edit destroys the todo
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click todo 1
+    And I clear the edit input and blur
+    Then there are 0 todos
+
+  Scenario: Escape discards changes
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click todo 1
+    And I type "Something else" in the edit field and press Escape
+    Then the first todo has title "Buy milk"
+
+  # ── Counter ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows active count
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    And I have completed todo 1
+    Then the active count is 1
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows correct pluralisation for zero
+    Then the counter text contains "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows correct pluralisation for one
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    Then the counter text contains "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows correct pluralisation for two
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    Then the counter text contains "2 items left"
+
+  # ── Routing ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: Default route shows all todos
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    And I have completed todo 1
+    When I navigate to "#/"
+    Then there are 2 todos visible
+
+  Scenario: Active filter shows only active
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    And I have completed todo 1
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then there is 1 todo visible
+    And the first visible todo has title "Walk dog"
+
+  Scenario: Completed filter shows only completed
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    And I have completed todo 1
+    When I navigate to "#/completed"
+    Then there is 1 todo visible
+    And the first visible todo has title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Active link is highlighted
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then the "active" filter link is selected
+
+  Scenario: Completed link is highlighted
+    When I navigate to "#/completed"
+    Then the "completed" filter link is selected
+
+  Scenario: All link is highlighted by default
+    Then the "all" filter link is selected
+
+  # ── Persistence ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+
+  Scenario: Todos survive reload
+    Given I have added "Buy milk"
+    And I have added "Walk dog"
+    And I have completed todo 1
+    When I reload the app
+    Then there are 2 todos
+    And todo 1 is completed
+    And todo 2 is not completed
